request.description:
Register a new student account

Expected 201 Response:
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "User created successfully",
  "user": {"_id": "USER_ID", "email": "testuser@engage.dev"}
}

Login and get JWT token

Expected 200 Response:
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Login successful",
  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...",
  "user": {"_id": "USER_ID", "email": "testuser@engage.dev"}
}

NOTE: Token auto-saves in {{authToken}} variable

Add sensor reading to your session

Expected 201 Response:
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Sensor data recorded",
  "sensorData": {"_id": "...", "sessionId": "YOUR_SESSION_ID"}
}

Tip: Add multiple readings (run 3-4 times) with different values
